- `BackupHistoryWidgetData.swift` — pure value types, SI-JSON adapter (`fmtDuration`, 30-day window, sort/slice/aggregate), and the `BackupHistoryViewState` machine.
- `BackupHistoryWidgetModel.swift` — `@Observable` model binding KMP `EnergyStore.teslaEnergySites()` + `teslaBackupHistory()` via `StateHolderModel`/`LoadableState`, decoding, refresh, `view.opened` telemetry (mapped to the fixed `TelemetryEvent.ScreenView` taxonomy, slug `BackupHistoryWidget`), plus the registered `BackupHistoryWidgetPanel`.
